Target acquired.

79
00:04:48,050 --> 00:04:49,090
I see.

80
00:04:49,520 --> 00:04:53,800
You make them suck the blood,
then take it all for yourself.

81
00:04:54,370 --> 00:04:57,790
You must be controlling the mosquitos
via some sort of signal.

82
00:04:58,800 --> 00:05:01,690
That would explain
their mysterious behavior.

83
00:05:02,420 --> 00:05:04,380
So if I were to get rid of you,
the leader,

84
00:05:04,990 --> 00:05:07,330
would the swarm disperse too?

85
00:05:09,020 --> 00:05:10,530
Our next meal is here.

86
00:05:10,600 --> 00:05:12,420
Go drain him dry.

87
00:05:18,260 --> 00:05:19,450
Incinerate.

88
00:05:29,500 --> 00:05:31,040
I'll eliminate you.{I am about to eliminate you.}

89
00:05:31,470 --> 00:05:32,960
So try no to move.{Stay where you are.}

90
00:05:37,920 --> 00:05:40,600
You're going to eliminate me?{You, eliminate me?}

91
00:05:42,140 --> 00:05:43,660
Come on and try it!{Go on and try!}

92
00:05:48,580 --> 00:05:49,430
Did I get it?{Got you.}

93
00:05:58,070 --> 00:06:00,100
Damn...mosquitos!!

94
00:06:28,000 --> 00:06:29,190
Incinerate.

95
00:06:41,330 --> 00:06:43,150
Maybe a leg next?

96
00:06:48,580 --> 00:06:49,930
Wait, where are my legs?

97
00:07:00,330 --> 00:07:01,460
Futile effort.{Impossible.}

98
00:07:04,610 --> 00:07:06,980
I won't let you escape.{You cannot escape from me.}

99
00:07:08,520 --> 00:07:10,290
What the hell is that guy?

100
00:07:11,030 --> 00:07:13,460
He's gonna get me
if I don't do something now.

101
00:07:15,520 --> 00:07:18,270
The townspeople may
all be hiding...

102
00:07:18,970 --> 00:07:21,450
but there are plenty
of animals around.

103
00:07:22,730 --> 00:07:25,750
Come here, little ones.

104
00:07:26,100 --> 00:07:29,780
Empty all your stored juices into me!

105
00:07:35,270 --> 00:07:36,130
So many.

106
00:07:36,590 --> 00:07:41,150
If she's been collecting blood
from the whole town and beyond,

107
00:07:41,410 --> 00:07:44,670
then it may not simply be
a food source for her.

108
00:07:45,760 --> 00:07:48,550
I should put an end to this
as soon as possible.

109
00:07:48,550 --> 00:07:49,990
Get back here, dammit!

110
00:07:50,390 --> 00:07:53,320
You and I aren't done yet!

111
00:07:54,570 --> 00:07:55,750
What's with this guy?

112
00:07:56,510 --> 00:07:59,470
It's in my mouth!
Pft! Pft! You little--!

113
00:07:59,510 --> 00:07:59,890
Huh?

114
00:08:00,660 --> 00:08:01,880
What's that squirming over there?

115
00:08:02,050 --> 00:08:03,240
Huh? Mosquitoes?!

116
00:08:05,440 --> 00:08:06,610
You over there.

117
00:08:07,630 --> 00:08:08,650
Evacuate now.

118
00:08:08,900 --> 00:08:10,650
That swarm is conscious.

119
00:08:11,120 --> 00:08:13,370
If it senses you,
it will immediately attack.

120
00:08:14,520 --> 00:08:15,380
Seriously?

121
00:08:15,950 --> 00:08:18,020
That's bad. I gotta get--

122
00:08:51,830 --> 00:08:56,410
Since you spoke, I thought you would have
at least human-level intelligence.

123
00:08:56,930 --> 00:08:58,280
But, In the end, you were just a bug.

124
00:08:59,320 --> 00:09:02,580
You brought all the mosquitos together
into one, easy-to-burn swarm.

125
00:09:03,740 --> 00:09:05,120
When I spotted you,

126
00:09:05,220 --> 00:09:09,290
I confirmed there were
no living beings within 500 meters,

127
00:09:09,960 --> 00:09:12,120
so I should have been free to fire away.

128
00:09:13,270 --> 00:09:14,670
Wait, that guy might have--

129
00:09:14,670 --> 00:09:18,180
Man, you saved me.
You're amazing.

130
00:09:18,520 --> 00:09:19,520
What was that just now?

131
00:09:19,590 --> 00:09:21,680
You totally made them bug out!

132
00:09:21,860 --> 00:09:22,810
Ba-dum-dum-tsh.

133
00:09:24,680 --> 00:09:28,450
Oh, I was just trying to make a joke
about the mosquitos being bugs, and...

134
00:09:33,010 --> 00:09:35,440
Idiots!

135
00:09:36,300 --> 00:09:39,520
I no longer need the tiny ones.

136
00:09:39,710 --> 00:09:40,970
Because...

137
00:09:46,750 --> 00:09:48,410
...look...

138
00:09:48,520 --> 00:09:51,050
how strong I've become!!

139
00:10:07,700 --> 00:10:11,690
Can't your punches
kill a little mosquito?

140
00:10:15,770 --> 00:10:17,260
Weakling!

141
00:10:17,410 --> 00:10:18,290
Now I see.

142
00:10:18,740 --> 00:10:23,470
The more blood she consumes,
the more powerful she becomes.

143
00:10:23,570 --> 00:10:26,700
I think I'll have your head next!

144
00:10:27,880 --> 00:10:31,690
I let my guard down.
There's no chance of winning.

145
00:10:32,890 --> 00:10:35,670
All I can do is self-destruct.

146
00:10:37,170 --> 00:10:39,270
Forgive me, Doctor...

147
00:10:47,980 --> 00:10:50,140
Mosquitos...suck!

148
00:10:53,760 --> 00:10:54,730
Hold on!

149
00:10:56,800 --> 00:10:58,360
Please tell me your name!

150
00:10:59,650 --> 00:11:01,730
Oh. It's Saitama.

151
00:11:02,710 --> 00:11:04,230
I'd like to be your disciple.

152
00:11:05,090 --> 00:11:06,370
Oh, okay.

153
00:11:09,690 --> 00:11:10,210
Huh?

